</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bb5de76a-751d-11f1-81f6-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26182168151091.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bb5de76a-751d-11f1-81f6-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26182168151091.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8468608a-752e-11f1-bd54-ad9b86483aa0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 14:07:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>视频 中国港口货物箱吞吐量创历史新高</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260701-%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E8%B4%A7%E7%89%A9%E7%AE%B1%E5%90%9E%E5%90%90%E9%87%8F%E5%88%9B%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98</link><description>
